abstract: "A research synthesis connecting constructed productive arrangements, the strategic possibilities they make available, collectable payments and successor reachability. It includes exact compositional-pricing verification, a staged productive construction with explicit participation and liquidity, strong conventional controls, and source-bound review of the public Omega mechanism experiment. The authored finite results do not establish empirical demand, autonomous invention superiority or complete real-world profitability."
